%% Reference Architecture: Governed Agentic AI for ITSM
%% Render with: https://mermaid.live or any Mermaid-compatible tool
%% GitHub renders .mermaid files natively in the browser.

flowchart LR
  %% Inputs
  U[User channels<br/>portal · chat · email · voice] --> ITSM[ITSM System of Record<br/>incidents · changes · KB]
  OBS[Observability<br/>metrics · logs · traces · events] --> EVT[Event intake & normalisation]
  CI[Service model<br/>CMDB · service map] --> CTX[Context enrichment]

  EVT --> TRIAGE[Triage Agent<br/>classify · dedupe · route]
  ITSM --> TRIAGE
  CTX --> TRIAGE

  TRIAGE --> DIAG[Diagnostics Agent<br/>query telemetry · build hypothesis]
  DIAG --> PLAN[Remediation Planner Agent<br/>propose steps + tool calls]

  %% Control plane
  subgraph CP[Control plane]
    POLICY[Policy engine · policy-as-code<br/>risk scoring · SoD · allowlists]
    APPROVAL[Human approval<br/>on-call · CAB · change owner]
    AUDIT[Immutable audit log<br/>who · what · why · when]
    EVAL[Evaluation harness<br/>offline replay · A/B · regression]
  end

  PLAN --> POLICY
  POLICY -->|allow| RUN[Tool runner<br/>idempotency · rate limits · budgets]
  POLICY -->|needs approval| APPROVAL --> RUN
  POLICY -->|deny| ITSM

  %% Tool layer
  subgraph TL[Tool layer]
    MCP[MCP tool servers<br/>typed contracts + versioning]
  end

  RUN --> MCP --> SYS[Enterprise systems<br/>infra · IAM · DNS · CI/CD · SaaS]
  SYS --> VALIDATE[Validation checks<br/>SLO · synthetic · health probes]
  VALIDATE -->|pass| CLOSE[Close/resolve + comms]
  VALIDATE -->|fail| ROLLBACK[Rollback path] --> SYS

  %% Evidence & feedback
  TRIAGE --> EVID[Evidence bundle store<br/>signals · plan · decision · logs · validation]
  DIAG --> EVID
  POLICY --> EVID
  RUN --> EVID
  VALIDATE --> EVID
  EVID --> AUDIT
  EVID --> EVAL
  CLOSE --> ITSM
